+- Missing handshake FD and altered helper bytes at each actual observer entry were correctly
+  rejected (3 cases). Region failure produces only an `incomplete` diagnostic.
+
+Support directory and phase-event path deliberately do not exist; the target run root and
+positive observer output files were not created. A retained v157/451 executable/source pair
