+PID/start arguments are explicit early-exit metadata sentinels, not observed target identity.
+Acceptance requires both process exit/receipt results, not merely parent return before the
+child consumes its final ACK.
+
+The original advisor read actual evidence and accepted this limited entry/clock result with
